{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object found, approach and take it, check object properties, move and do specific task. Finally scan or explore. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Action ID = ScanArea    /> <Action ID = ExploreArea    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectFound    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectWithinRange    />",
